     These functions may fail with the following errors:

     [DW_DLE_ARGUMENT]       Either of the arguments _d_i_e or _r_e_t was NULL.

     [DW_DLE_NO_ENTRY]       Argument _d_i_e did not contain an attribute corre‐
                             sponding to the value in argument _a_t_t_r.

     [DW_DLE_ATTR_FORM_BAD]  The attribute named by argument _a_t_t_r was not of a
                             permitted form.

